{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Directive</strong> is a first-person surveillance horror game. Assigned to monitor live surveillance feeds, you must identify and report anomalies before the threat escalates beyond containment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a newly hired operator of a surveillance system led by by a man simply known at &quot;The Director&quot;. Your mission is simple: identify and report anomalies as they occur.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you spot an anomaly, report it via the <strong>Report Anomaly</strong> interface. Mind your entries - <i>the Director does not forgive errors</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052400/extras/7d9f291271928308c3c56d9e732d37dc.poster.avif?t=1771908244\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052400/extras/7d9f291271928308c3c56d9e732d37dc.webm?t=1771908244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052400/extras/7d9f291271928308c3c56d9e732d37dc.mp4?t=1771908244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Surveillance Horror Gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Spot and report anomalies before they overwhelm you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Psychological Horror Atmosphere:</strong>\u00a0Observe camera feeds after the escape of a malevolent entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Multiple Anomaly Types:</strong>\u00a0Some anomalies hide in plain site. Others are impossible to ignore. You never know what's lurking on the next camera feed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Replayability:</strong> Randomized anomaly patterns ensure no two sessions feel the same. Over a dozen unique anomaly types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052400/extras/11d55124f82025e2b35eb2a2c092c588.poster.avif?t=1771908244\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052400/extras/11d55124f82025e2b35eb2a2c092c588.webm?t=1771908244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052400/extras/11d55124f82025e2b35eb2a2c092c588.mp4?t=1771908244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052400?t=1771908244","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052400?t=1771908244","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052400/cb89ba1c68a53ae9d0752ce387f8059b126b2562/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771908244","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052400/cb89ba1c68a53ae9d0752ce387f8059b126b2562/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771908244","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Depictions of blood and gore. Depictions of dead bodies."},"demos":[{"appid":4143540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Directive</strong> is a first-person surveillance horror game. Assigned to monitor live surveillance feeds, you must identify and report anomalies before the threat escalates beyond containment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a newly hired operator of a surveillance system led by by a man simply known at &quot;